## Out of scope
- **Warmup** (N/M/T icount window, per-slice SimPoint warmup): removed from this
  plan. icount/SimPoint switch at a single boundary. Revisit separately if
  pipeline-warmed numbers are needed (gem5 reference: `~/work/gem5/specs/warmup.md`).
- **Kanata / clarity pipeline trace** recording or comparison in demos: demos
  report cycles/IPC only.
- Deeper pipeline counters beyond `mcycle`/`minstret` (would need RTL/Verilator
  signal taps) - separate large effort.

